<%- include('partials-shell-start', { title: 'New forward', active: 'new' }) %><header><div><p class="eyebrow">RULE BUILDER</p><h1>New port forward</h1><p class="muted">Define a consistently named service, NAT policy, and access rule.</p></div></header><form method="post" class="panel form-card"><div class="step"><b>1</b><div><h2>Rule identity</h2><p class="muted">Use a descriptive name your team will recognize.</p></div></div><div class="grid"><label class="wide">Rule name<input name="name" required placeholder="e.g. Warehouse camera HTTPS"></label><label>Firewall<select name="firewallId" required><option value="">Select a firewall</option><% firewalls.forEach((fw) => { %><option value="<%= fw.id %>"><%= fw.name %> · <%= fw.host %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Protocol<select name="protocol"><option>TCP</option><option>UDP</option><option>TCP/UDP</option></select></label></div><hr><div class="step"><b>2</b><div><h2>Traffic mapping</h2><p class="muted">Define the public listener and private target.</p></div></div><div class="mapping"><div><h3>Public endpoint</h3><label>External IP<input name="externalIp" required placeholder="203.0.113.20"></label><label>Source / public port<input name="sourcePort" type="number" min="1" max="65535" required placeholder="443"></label></div><span>→</span><div><h3>Internal destination</h3><label>Internal IP<input name="internalIp" required placeholder="10.20.0.15"></label><label>Destination / private port<input name="destinationPort" type="number" min="1" max="65535" required placeholder="8443"></label></div></div><hr><div class="step"><b>3</b><div><h2>Source restriction</h2><p class="muted">Use Any, a single address, or comma-separated CIDR networks.</p></div></div><label>Allowed external source IPs<input name="sourceIps" value="Any" placeholder="Any or 198.51.100.0/24"></label><div class="grid"><label>Source zone<input name="fromZone" value="WAN" required></label><label>Destination zone<input name="toZone" value="LAN" required></label><label>Inbound interface<input name="inboundInterface" value="Any" required></label><label>Outbound interface<input name="outboundInterface" value="Any" required></label></div><p class="muted">Zone and interface names must exactly match the SonicWall configuration.</p><div class="form-actions"><a href="/">Cancel</a><button class="primary">Create port forward →</button></div></form><%- include('partials-shell-end') %>
